window.EN={"1":"Newly joining them were Saul, a priest of the Elimine Church, and his guardian Dorothy,","2":"and Roy's group passed through the mountain road","3":"and set foot in the domain of Lord Thria, located southeast of Ostia.","4":"Lord Oleg of Thria, a cousin of the late Lord of Ostia, known for his gentle character —","5":"this castle he governed seemed, at first, like a safe place for Roy's group.","6":"But even here, Bern's dark hand was steadily reaching...","7":"Haah~ I broke in to steal something, but there's nothing decent here, huh.","8":"The north annex has tight security, so I can't get close... but I bet there's something good there.","9":"Ah, footsteps...","10":"Everything's going without a hitch.","11":"Yes, we've stationed soldiers throughout the mansion.","12":"Once we've lured them deep into the mansion, strike all at once.","13":"Just like when we assassinated Lord Oleg of Thria.","14":"Yes, sir.","15":"Just don't harm Princess Guinivere. The rest, dead or alive, doesn't matter. Go.","16":"Heh heh heh...","17":"The treasure in the north annex, that granddaughter of the \"Grey Wolf,\" and Princess Guinivere...","18":"With gifts like these, Bern should value us quite highly.","19":"Hmm. This might be getting interesting.","20":"Oh, what a relief, Lord Roy. Tonight we can finally sleep soundly for the first time in a while!","21":"I wonder about that... that man who claims to be Lord Thria's attendant...","22":"Wagner, you mean? Hm, did something about him bother you?","23":"He was acting like he owned the place, handling everything himself, wasn't he?","24":"And besides, we weren't even allowed to see Lord Thria's face because he's supposedly ill.","25":"Hmm, true enough.","26":"Lord Roy! Excuse me.","27":"It looks like a large number of soldiers are prowling around the mansion...","28":"I think this means we're being watched, don't you?","29":"No way...","30":"Heh, pretty sharp instincts you've got there.","31":"Who's there!?","32":"Yo~","33":"Who are you?","34":"Never mind who I am.","35":"More importantly, I overheard something in the hall just now — looks like you guys are about to be ambushed.","36":"Lord Thria isn't that kind of person!","37":"Oh, that guy? Seems like he was already assassinated by some creepy dark mage.","38":"What did you say!?","39":"And apparently they're planning to use you guys as a gift to curry favor with the King of Bern.","40":"Lord Roy, this is no good — you mustn't trust what someone like this says...","41":"Believe it or not, that's up to you, but don't come crying to me if you regret it later~","42":"Lord Roy... what she just said...","43":"Let's pretend to head outside and test it.","44":"If they're targeting us, they should make some kind of move then.","45":"If you're planning to go outside, I recommend going through the north annex~!","46":"That leads straight to the back gate, so you can dash right across the courtyard.","47":"L-Lord Roy, wherever are you going? I was just about to show you further inside the mansion...","48":"Something urgent has come up.","49":"I'm sorry, but we'll be taking our leave.","50":"B-but that won't do... if we sent off the son of Lord Pherae without even entertaining him properly...","51":"My lord would scold me for it! Please, even just for tonight...","52":"I'll personally tell Lord Oleg that none of this is your fault.","53":"I'd like to pay my respects as well, so please show me to his room.","54":"That's why I keep saying, my lord cannot meet anyone due to his illness...","55":"Then we'll be taking our leave as we are.","56":"...No matter what?","57":"......","58":"Then you'll just have to die right here!","59":"Everyone! Strike down every last one of them!","60":"Ngh! Just as I thought!!","61":"Lord Roy! Even if we try to escape now, it looks like we'll be pursued from behind.","62":"Then first, we take control of this mansion! Everyone, follow me!!","63":"So noisy...","64":"Is this \"sound\" a battle? What's going on outside?","65":"Ooh, they're at it, they're really at it.","66":"Well then, while they're distracted, shall I just take whatever I can get?","67":"Who's there?","68":"Huh? Why is there a girl here...?","69":"? You're not from the mansion?","70":"...Who are you? Oh, I'm Roy.","71":"I'm Sue. Is that \"sound\" outside because of you?","72":"Sound?","73":"The \"sound\" of battle.","74":"Yeah, for certain reasons, we're fighting the people of this mansion right now.","75":"I see. Then I'm on your side.","76":"?","77":"Because the people of this mansion are my enemies too.","78":"Huh? What do you mean by that...?","79":"For now, lend me a bow.","80":"I think I can be useful.","81":"You're...","82":"Ah, uh-oh!","83":"Wait a second!","84":"Hey, what are you doing!? Let go of my arm! That hurts!","85":"Ah, s-sorry. But why are you here?","86":"Well, um, it's... a lot of things happened, haha...","87":"A lot of things? Here on a battlefield?","88":"Isn't it because it's a battlefield that a lot of things happen...? Oops.","89":"...Could it be that you have some other purpose here?","90":"Gulp.","91":"Don't tell me that's why you told us about the escape route...","92":"W-well now, whatever could you mean?","93":"Just who are you...?","94":"Now now, don't worry about the little details!","95":"Well, see ya! Bye-bye!","96":"W-wait!","97":"Tch, what useless subordinates... can't be helped, I suppose.","98":"My dark magic... why don't you experience it firsthand.","99":"M-my... my perfect plan...","100":"(Only if Sue has been recruited and is alive)","101":"...I see. So you're the granddaughter of a tribal chief from the Sacae plains...","102":"Grandpa's the strongest warrior in all of Sacae. Everyone calls him the \"Grey Wolf.\"","103":"The \"Grey Wolf,\" huh... I have indeed heard of him.","104":"But why Lycia? Sacae's plains are way out to the east, aren't they?","105":"Because Bern invaded Sacae.","106":"We, the Kutolah tribe, decided to fight against Bern.","107":"So Grandpa tried to get the tribe's women and children to flee here to Lycia. But...","108":"But?","109":"But there was a traitor.","110":"Partway through, the Djute tribe, who serve Bern, were lying in ambush...","111":"......","112":"Everyone got scattered.","113":"I somehow fought my way through and escaped to this place.","114":"The lord here, Lord Oleg of Thria, kindly took me in and hid me, but...","115":"his steward Wagner assassinated Lord Oleg and took over this mansion. At that time, I too...","116":"You mean you were captured...","117":"Are you all fighting against Bern?","118":"Yeah, Bern attacked our homeland too.","119":"Then let me fight alongside you too.","120":"Fighting against Bern will be helping Grandpa and the others.","121":"And besides, I want to avenge Lord Oleg, who was so kind to me.","122":"We're headed for Ostia.","123":"That's the opposite direction from the Sacae plains. Are you sure that's alright?","124":"I don't mind. No matter where I am,","125":"the Mother Earth won't disappear, and the Father Sky won't vanish either.","126":"Lord Roy, this is terrible!","127":"The messenger we sent to Ostia has just returned, and...","128":"It seems that Ostia is in a state of civil unrest.","129":"What!?","130":"Apparently a faction trying to surrender to Bern has started a rebellion...","131":"Then what about Lilina?","132":"It seems she's been taken prisoner.","133":"Right now the rebel army has occupied Ostia's castle,","134":"and there's apparently fierce fighting repeating between them and the forces trying to take back the castle along with Lady Lilina.","135":"We can't just sit here. Let's rush to Ostia!","136":"Lilina... please, be safe!"};
